# Toph, Hardheaded Teacher ({2}{R}{G}, 3/4): "When Toph enters, you may discard a card. If you do, return target instant or sorcery card from
# your graveyard to your hand." Bot1's Lightning Bolt (cast on turn 1) is in its graveyard, and so is Bot2's own Bolt (cast on turn 2,
# at Bot1): only Bot1's can be returned. Bot1 casts Toph on turn 3 and discards a Plains: the Bolt comes back to the hand (the Plains
# in its place is in the graveyard), and Bot2's Bolt stays in Bot2's graveyard (with an Island from its hand-size discard).

